    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67478" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηνιγγο-φύλαξ</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ],
